* Ternary Adder Full Truth-Table Testbench (5V0 Domain)
* Tests 3 ternary_input states (0V, 2.5V, 5.0V) x 4 (ctrl_over, ctrl_sign) states

* 1. PDK Models (GF180MCU)
.include "$PDK_ROOT/gf180mcuD/libs.tech/ngspice/design.ngspice"
.lib "$PDK_ROOT/gf180mcuD/libs.tech/ngspice/sm141064.ngspice" typical

* 2. Include your Magic-extracted netlist
.include "5v0_add_ccal_sc_r1_v2.spice"

Vdd VDD_3V3  0 DC 5.0
Vss VSS      0 DC 0.0
Vin_sign   in_sign   0 PULSE(0.0 5.0 0 100p 100p  4.9n  10n)
Vin_over   in_over   0 PULSE(0.0 5.0 0 100p 100p  9.9n  20n)
Vctrl_sign ctrl_sign 0 PULSE(0.0 5.0 0 100p 100p 19.9n  40n)
Vctrl_over ctrl_over 0 PULSE(0.0 5.0 0 100p 100p 39.9n  80n)


* 6. Output capacitive load
CLoad_sign res_sign 0 10ff
CLoad_over res_over 0 10ff

* 7. Simulation & Plotting Commands
.tran 10p 80n
.op

.control
run

* Plot inputs (stacked visually by adding voltage offsets for readability)
plot v(ctrl_over)+16 v(ctrl_sign)+11 v(in_over)+6 v(in_sign)

* Plot outputs
plot v(res_sign) v(res_over)

plot i(Vss)
.endc
.end